'''J.J. Jackrabbit''' (オオウサ銀, ''Ōusagin'') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of [[B.B.Bunny]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]]'s [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. It was added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]].

