==Enemy==
A B.B.Bunny with bigger ears, bigger range (150), and a slightly bigger money drop. At the 200% strength magnification it's usually buffed to, it has 130k HP and about 12.5k DPS, which is delivered through two consecutive hits that deal 9k damage each. Interestingly enough, the second hit also adds 100 piercing range, meaning units with under 150 range will suffer double damage. With their piercing range and 30% chance to knockback cats, groups of J.J. Jackrabbits can push at an alarming rate.

==Strategy==
J.J. Jackrabbit's strengths are defined by its swift, piercing multi-hits. Units like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]], [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Luxury Bath Cat]], and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] are recommended to take it out, as when supported properly, they can deal high quantities of reliable damage to it. Alternatively, you can use [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] if there are no meatshields in the way to snipe them. Its Colossus attribute is harder to exploit, but there are still a handful of units able to capitalize on this, such as [[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Awakened Urs]] and [[Cat Tengu (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Tengu]].

