==Trivia==
*Although J.J.Jackrabbit's description calls it a bunny (meaning a rabbit), [[wikipedia:Jackrabbit|jackrabbits]] are hares, not rabbits.
*J.J. Jackrabbit's Japanese name, オオウサ銀 ''Ōusagin'', is derived from 大 ''ō'' (big), 兎 ''usagi'' (rabbit), 銀 ''gin'' (money) and いぶしぎん ''ibushigin'' (something that is impressive without being flashy; this term is used in [[B.B.Bunny]]'s Japanese description). It may also involve the obsolete word 大小 ''ōsa'' (size) or 多さ ''ōsa'' ("much-ness"/"many-ness").
*According to J.J. Jackrabbit's Japanese description, B.B.Bunny was set to become the first [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] but switched places with [[Sir Seal]] partway through, leading to an incomplete J.J. Jackrabbit and the creation of [[Baron Seal]].
*J.J. Jackrabbit is the first Colossus enemy to:
**Appear outside of [[Gauntlet]]s.
**Lack its own Gauntlet.
**Be a peon rather than a singular threat.
**Have had the Colossus type from the start rather than gaining it retroactively.

